----
-name: workflow-definition-sprints
-description: Since sprint 020 the chain lives in .asd/workflows/<name>.json; predecessor pins reach checkpoints.md plus the acting-site workflow lines, all three design-collapse sites pinned (closed in 020 wave-1 review-fix); still grep+compare per new workflow; name-guard needs existing target; step-citation predicates; memory dir swept
-metadata:
